#: src/ui/o42-dialogs-data.c:280
msgid ""
"The criteria range names fields in its first row; each row after it is a set "
"of conditions that must all hold, and any one row is enough. A condition is "
"\">5\", \"<>Japan\", \"*land\" or a value to equal."
msgstr ""
